"smart_blocks:sistemas-psicologicos-contemporaneos-ii/material/spcii-u1-gtp.md#Unidad 1 – Geopolítica y Psicología:###**1\\) ¿Cómo definirías la perspectiva decolonial y cuál es su relevancia en el campo de la psicología?**": {"path":null,"last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"text":null,"length":0,"last_read":{"at":1784055015827,"hash":"18h2cp9"},"key":"sistemas-psicologicos-contemporaneos-ii/material/spcii-u1-gtp.md#Unidad 1 – Geopolítica y Psicología:###**1\\) ¿Cómo definirías la perspectiva decolonial y cuál es su relevancia en el campo de la psicología?**","lines":[111,112],"size":110,"outlinks":[],"class_name":"SmartBlock"},
"smart_blocks:sistemas-psicologicos-contemporaneos-ii/material/spcii-u1-gtp.md#Unidad 1 – Geopolítica y Psicología:###La perspectiva decolonial se define como un ejercicio de **revisión constante e imaginación propositiva** para criticar los saberes y las prácticas disciplinares. Implica cuestionar críticamente el **ropaje de universalidad** que nutre la psicología, analizando qué saberes y prácticas conformaron su matriz disciplinar y bajo qué condiciones históricas se esgrimieron como tales. Su relevancia en la psicología radica en que permite **repensar la localización geopolítica** y las perspectivas asumidas, e interpela a las estructuras generadoras de conocimiento a revisar las maneras de hacer y transmitir ciencia.": {"path":null,"last_embed":{"hash":"17t965b","at":1784054973989},"embeddings":{"TaylorAI/bge-micro-v2":{"vec":[-0.01988092,0.02207412,0.06282528,-0.01055066,-0.03593111,-0.00469966,-0.00329673,0.02927665,0.00382783,-0.01339572,-0.04195064,-0.09228776,-0.00527752,0.04365347,0.02530219,-0.01036407,-0.02279354,0.076375,-0.03033303,-0.01259236,0.18345946,-0.03558027,-0.03965218,-0.06229788,-0.00695742,0.03208883,-0.04480955,-0.02419749,-0.01742831,-0.20891739,0.02423001,0.00185339,0.00831921,-0.0163481,-0.02252424,0.03214234,-0.07809077,-0.01053559,-0.07882652,0.09322216,0.04307937,0.02962497,-0.02508297,-0.02475455,-0.05148265,-0.11982147,-0.00312701,0.01210772,-0.0892383,-0.0030616,-0.02027843,0.05632044,-0.02055077,0.02678257,-0.0144903,0.03251405,0.04588965,0.06177109,0.01433834,0.02179094,0.08369184,0.0500594,-0.24856603,0.05250128,0.05975637,0.01673858,-0.03507806,0.0119441,0.00072149,0.02075968,-0.05332218,0.00985349,0.03645618,0.06970024,0.0428062,0.0240847,-0.06131274,-0.01867058,-0.02719419,0.05503099,0.05679937,0.09632657,-0.05503023,-0.05028399,-0.00956939,-0.07261276,0.05483074,-0.03585582,0.02542401,0.03171015,-0.05501283,-0.05715468,0.03533686,0.01643861,-0.01762787,-0.00595569,-0.01574407,0.08968691,0.03485006,0.08824001,-0.02519155,-