"smart_blocks:sistemas-psicologicos-contemporaneos-ii/material/spcii-u1-gtp.md#Unidad 1 – Geopolítica y Psicología:###Los autores describen el carácter interseccional de la perspectiva decolonial señalando que **todas las formas de colonialidad están entretejidas** de tal manera que resultan **inseparables la clase, la raza y el género**. La confluencia de estos sistemas de dominación atenta contra la diversidad y condena a los sujetos desplazados a carecer de historia, conocimiento o voz propia. La interseccionalidad ha enriquecido las teorías decoloniales al poner en evidencia que el sesgo en el discurso colonizador es tanto **imperialista como patriarcal**. Al enseñar, implica criticar, junto a la colonización científica, los **sesgos patriarcales, sexistas y heteronormativos** que se presentan bajo la apariencia de universalidad o neutralidad.": {"path":null,"last_embed":{"hash":"1ndub1b","at":1784054974058},"embeddings":{"TaylorAI/bge-micro-v2":{"vec":[-0.01502986,0.02755459,0.05493118,-0.02242757,-0.02203791,-0.01643618,-0.00825976,0.01062721,0.01002993,-0.03170856,-0.0362356,-0.09579927,0.00186043,0.07257858,0.0666852,-0.00876387,-0.02659869,0.06785221,-0.06821778,-0.00238171,0.16138738,-0.04339918,-0.03440972,-0.04921189,-0.03547662,0.00880121,-0.0178955,-0.00212518,-0.00896541,-0.22266112,0.01349246,0.00744617,0.00329133,-0.02556544,-0.01559773,0.03485988,-0.06127913,-0.02577486,-0.08112192,0.06028857,0.06294387,0.02142153,-0.02256723,0.00721808,-0.02807627,-0.11499444,-0.02790574,-0.01016013,-0.0921246,-0.0168553,-0.02856984,0.03712038,-0.01673223,0.01769718,-0.03899189,0.03704661,0.06052221,0.03183723,0.01694299,0.03239254,0.07634339,0.07298291,-0.24088006,0.05667984,0.05413809,0.03164025,-0.03712727,0.02684613,0.00898681,0.01935386,-0.06810434,0.00198258,0.05906577,0.05982682,0.05607508,0.02515135,-0.04590013,-0.05371602,0.00135619,0.04242038,0.07786344,0.08126456,-0.02507151,-0.04727129,0.00481074,-0.07057294,0.06826812,-0.04520184,0.00661345,0.00331711